        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE Lettings take great pleasure in introducing this fantastic 1 bed / 1 bath apartment to the letting market in The Atrium, Foley Street, Dublin 1.\nLocated in the heart of Dublin 1, The Atrium is within easy reach of Dublin City Centre, with a host of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities right on your doorstep. Excellent public transport links are also close by, making this an ideal location for city living.\nThe property comprises of an entrance hallway, bright and spacious living/dining area, fully fitted kitchen, one double bedroom and main bathroom. The apartment is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from well-proportioned living accommodation.\nThis property is sure to appeal to a wide range of tenants looking for a well-located city centre home. Viewing is highly advised contact Ray Cooke Lettings today to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n- 1 bed / 1 bath\n- Apartment\n- Fantastic condition throughout\n- Comes fully furnished\n- Top quality windows & doors\n- Top quality fixtures & fittings\n- Top quality flooring\n- Very spacious rooms\n- Overlooking green area\n- Open plan kitchen/dining/living area\n- Fully fitted kitchen\n- Integrated appliances\n- Low maintenance balcony\n-Super location\n- Located in the heart of Dublin 1\n- All local amenities within a short stroll\n- Ideal for a wide range of tenants\n- Viewing highly advised\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
